#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First public release of Ditana GNU/Linux — the foundational beta from December 2024."
msgstr "Emprima versiun publica da Ditana GNU/Linux – la versiun Beta fundamentala dal december 2024."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "0.9 Beta release notes"
msgstr "Remartgas davart la versiun 0.9 Beta"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"The first public beta of Ditana GNU/Linux. This release established the "
"foundation: an Arch-based system targeting educated enthusiasts who want "
"both transparency and convenience, with security as a first-class concern "
"rather than an afterthought."
msgstr ""
"L’emprima versiun Beta publica da Ditana GNU/Linux. Questa versiun ha creà "
"la basa: in sistem sin basa dad Arch per persunas entusiasmadas cun buna "
"furmaziun che vulan tant transparenza sco er commoditad, cun la segirezza "
"sco tema da plaina valur e betg sco chaussa secundara."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Puncts culminants"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**Hardware-aware installer.** Dialog-driven installation that considered "
"hardware specifics and inter-package dependencies — particularly NVIDIA "
"detection across legacy and modern GPUs."
msgstr ""
"**Installatur che resguarda la hardware.** Installaziun guidada da dialogs "
"che resguardava las particularitads da la hardware e las dependenzas tranter "
"ils pachets – cunzunt l’identificaziun da NVIDIA tar GPUs veglias e modernas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**XFCE desktop environment** as the single shipped option, with pre-"
"installed enhancements including the Docklike Taskbar."
msgstr ""
"**Sistem da desktop XFCE** sco suletta opziun furnida, cun meglieraziuns "
"installadas ordavant, tranter auter la Docklike Taskbar."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**Modular package structure.** Distribution-specific behaviour split into "
"individual Arch packages, laying the groundwork for the later configuration-"
"as-data refactor."
msgstr ""
"**Structura modulara dals pachets.** Il cumportament specific da la "
"distribuziun è vegnì repartì en singuls pachets dad Arch, quai che ha creà "
"la basa per la restructuraziun posteriura tenor il princip da la "
"configuraziun sco datas."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**CPU vulnerability detection and mitigation.** Per-CPU detection of "
"speculative execution vulnerabilities (Spectre v2, Meltdown, MDS, TAA, MMIO "
"Stale Data, RETBleed, SRSO, GDS, RFDS) with documented per-mitigation trade-"
"offs in the installer dialog — already a Ditana hallmark in this first "
"release."
msgstr ""
"**Identificaziun e mitigiaziun da mancanzas da segirezza da la CPU.** "
"Identificaziun per mintga CPU da las mancanzas da segirezza da l’execuziun "
"speculativa (Spectre v2, Meltdown, MDS, TAA, MMIO Stale Data, RETBleed, "
"SRSO, GDS, RFDS) cun ils cumpromiss da mintga mitigiaziun documentads en il "
"dialog da l’installatur – gia en questa emprima versiun ina caracteristica "
"da Ditana."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**Security defaults out of the box.** Firewall pre-configured, optional "
"system partition encryption, restrictive sysctl baseline."
msgstr ""
"**Parameters da segirezza da standard directamain suenter l’installaziun.** "
"Firewall configurà ordavant, criptadi opziunal da la partiziun dal sistem, "
"basa restrictiva per sysctl."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**Performance defaults.** Weekly TRIM scheduling on supported SSDs, ZRAM, "
"rate-mirrors for fastest mirror selection."
msgstr ""
"**Parameters da prestaziun da standard.** TRIM planisà ina giada per emna "
"sin SSDs sustegnids, ZRAM, rate-mirrors per tscherner ils mirrors ils pli "
"svelts."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"**Headless support.** A single ISO that could deploy either a desktop system "
"or a headless one, decided in the installer."
msgstr ""
"**Sustegn per sistems senza interfatscha grafica.** In sulet ISO che pudeva "
"installar u in sistem da desktop u in sistem senza interfatscha grafica, "
"tenor la decisiun en l’installatur."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "Rapports en las medias"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"Released on 31 December 2024 and covered shortly after on [gnulinux.ch]"
"(https://gnulinux.ch/ciw119-podcast) in an hour-long interview with Ralf "
"Hersel. A DistroWatch banner ran from 12 January to 3 February 2025, drawing "
"approximately 120,000 impressions."
msgstr ""
"Publitgada ils 31 da december 2024 e tractada curt suenter sin [gnulinux.ch]"
"(https://gnulinux.ch/ciw119-podcast) en in’intervista d’ina ura cun Ralf "
"Hersel. Ina banderola da reclama sin DistroWatch è vegnida mussada dals 12 "
"da schaner fin ils 3 da favrer 2025 ed ha generà var 120 000 impressiuns."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What changed since"
msgstr "Tge ch’è sa midà dapi lura"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"The 0.9.3 release rebuilt almost everything around the principle of "
"[configuration as data](/under-the-hood/configuration-as-data/), expanded "
"the desktop environment selection from one to four (XFCE, Wayfire, Niri, "
"COSMIC), added a dedicated [system hardening dialog](/under-the-hood/"
"mitigations/), introduced [Flatpak integration](/best-practices/aur-vs-"
"flatpak/), and migrated the configuration management layer from Ansible to "
"Sparrow6. See the [0.9.3 release notes](/release-notes/0-9-3-beta/) for the "
"full list."
msgstr ""
"La versiun 0.9.3 ha reconstruì quasi tut enturn il princip da la "
"[configuraziun sco datas](/under-the-hood/configuration-as-data/), ha "
"extendì la tscherna da sistems da desktop dad in a quatter (XFCE, Wayfire, "
"Niri, COSMIC), ha agiuntà in agen [dialog dal rinforzament dal sistem](/"
"under-the-hood/mitigations/), ha introducì l’[integraziun da Flatpak](/best-"
"practices/aur-vs-flatpak/) ed ha migrà la stresa da la gestiun da la "
"configuraziun dad Ansible a Sparrow6. La glista cumpletta chattais Vus en "
"las [remartgas davart la versiun 0.9.3](/release-notes/0-9-3-beta/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-0-beta.md
msgid ""
"Since then, 0.9.4 has restricted unprivileged user namespaces to the "
"executables that require them rather than disabling them entirely, "
"introduced unattended installation via an answer file, and made every "
"package build public. See the [0.9.4 release notes](/release-notes/0-9-4-"
"beta/) for the current release."
msgstr ""
"Dapi lura ha la versiun 0.9.4 restrenschì ils spazis da num da l’utilisader "
"senza privilegis als programs exequibels che dovran els, empè da deactivar "
"els dal tuttafatg, ha introducì l’installaziun senza surveglianza cun ina "
"datoteca da respostas ed ha rendì public mintga build da pachets. Per la "
"versiun actuala consultai las [remartgas davart la versiun 0.9.4](/release-"
"notes/0-9-4-beta/)."
